        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I would just like to say that I believe LK is the best guild out there(Am I bias?<img src=icon_smile.gif border=0 align=middle>)We are willing to help each other out and help those who are not apart of our family.  There has been many times when I have been in a group or just passing by and some says to me "Oh, you are LK, I know(or have grouped with) SoandSo.  It makes me feel good to know that i am apart of a guild that has a good reputation and is well know throughout Norrath.</P><P>Even though we have lost some members recently for one reason or another, it is not one member of the guild that makes it so great, but all the members as a whole.</P><P>Amarantha<BR>Level 37 Enchanter</P><P><BR>"We must indeed all hang together, or most assuredly we shall all hang seperately" - Benjamin Franklin</P><P></P><P>Edited by - Amarantha on 03 Apr 2001  14:26:35<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
